Llama 3.3 (hazard training data)
--------------------------------
The synthetic portion of the hazard-detection training corpus
(examples/hazard/data/hazard_corpus.json) was distilled from Meta's
Llama 3.3 70B Instruct model via API. Per section 1.b of the
Llama 3.3 Community License:

    Llama 3.3 is licensed under the Llama 3.3 Community License,
    Copyright © Meta Platforms, Inc. All Rights Reserved.

Built with Llama. The int8 student trained on those outputs (referred to as
"hazard-sniffer" in the build artifacts) carries the name Llama-hazard-sniffer
per section 1.b.i of that license. The license text is available at
https://github.com/meta-llama/llama-models/blob/main/models/llama3_3/LICENSE

Speech Commands v0.02 (keyword-spotting data)
---------------------------------------------
The tracked keyword-spotting corpus (examples/kws/kws_processed_data.pt)
is a log-mel feature extraction of the Google Speech Commands v0.02 test
archive:

    Speech Commands v0.02 (Warden, 2018, arXiv:1804.03209), CC BY 4.0
    (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
